    "shortlink": "https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl-ucr/",
    "description": "<p>To foster the development of Shapes Constraint Language\r\n(SHACL) this document includes a set of use cases and requirements that\r\nmotivate a simple language and semantics for formulating structural\r\nconstraints on RDF graphs. All use cases provide realistic examples\r\ndescribing how people may use structural constraints to validate RDF\r\ninstance data.</p>",
